<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Game systems" data-copy-zh="游戏系统">Game systems</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Ruxandra’s Alchemy Shop" data-copy-zh="Ruxandra 的炼金商店">Ruxandra’s Alchemy Shop</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Reach Blood Alchemy, decide how to use Blood Orbs, and compare six artifacts and two repeatable refinements." data-copy-zh="找到血液炼金商店，规划鲜血宝珠的用途，比较六件永久物品与两项可重复强化。">Reach Blood Alchemy, decide how to use Blood Orbs, and compare six artifacts and two repeatable refinements.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Blood Orbs into permanent upgrades</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-access">Reaching the laboratory</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-orbs">Save or consume your Blood Orbs?</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-use">Buying from the shop</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-artifacts">The six permanent artifacts</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-refinements">Repeatable refinements</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">If a purchase is missing or disabled</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">用鲜血宝珠换永久升级</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-access">如何前往实验室</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-orbs">鲜血宝珠该使用还是留着？</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-use">商店怎么用</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-artifacts">六件永久物品</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-refinements">两项可重复强化</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">找不到商品或无法购买时</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><p class="starter-reading-note" data-copy-en="Select a screenshot to enlarge it. Screens show example inventories and progress." data-copy-zh="点击截图可放大查看。图中的库存和进度仅为示例，请以自己的实际情况为准。">Select a screenshot to enlarge it. Screens show example inventories and progress.</p><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Vampire_damage_and_Sleep_details"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Using_the_Shop"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Finding_the_Shop"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Blood Orbs into permanent upgrades</h2><p><strong>Ruxandra’s Blood Alchemy</strong> exchanges Blood Orbs for six permanent artifacts and two repeatable refinements. Find it in the <strong>Vampire Laboratory</strong> inside the Vampire Lair. Opening and using the shop take no in-game time.</p><p>You need <strong>effective Vampire 25 or higher</strong> to open Blood Alchemy. Applicable Vampire modifiers count. No particular relationship stage or personal-scene completion is required, and the <strong>Vampirism</strong> skill is optional: it improves two artifacts’ effects rather than unlocking the shop.</p><p>Bring <strong>unconsumed Blood Orbs</strong>. Wealth, Crystals and Dragon Coins do not pay the listed prices. The six unique artifacts together cost <strong>365 Blood Orbs</strong>; repeatable upgrades use the same balance.</p></section>
<section id="en-access"><h2>Reaching the laboratory</h2><p>Ruxandra is in the laboratory all day. Enter the Vampire Lair, go to the <strong>Vampire Laboratory</strong>, then choose <strong>Blood Alchemy</strong> from the location actions.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Route</th><th scope="col">How it opens</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Normal dungeon</th><td data-label="How it opens">Reach floor 23 and enter its Castle tile. This entrance does not require story beat 61.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">City Library shortcut</th><td data-label="How it opens">After story beat 61: Present → Uptown → City Library (Uptown) → Library Basement → Dark Corridor → Vampire Lair → Vampire Laboratory.</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The City Library normally opens <strong>08:00–22:00</strong>; a temporary story closure can also prevent entry. From Downtown, the metro’s <strong>Travel to Uptown</strong> action takes 30 minutes, then use the Uptown map’s Library icon. Once inside the library, the basement-to-laboratory travel actions take no time.</p><p>The lair’s Return to Dungeon portal returns you to the crawl. Its travel access and Ruxandra’s personal scenes have their own conditions; neither replaces the shop’s Vampire requirement.</p></section>
<section id="en-orbs"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Getting_more_Blood_Orbs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Blood_Orbs"></span><h2>Save or consume your Blood Orbs?</h2><p>A Blood Orb has two distinct uses. <strong>Using one in inventory</strong> consumes it, adds +1 base Vampire up to 999, and restores current Health, Energy, Calm and Satiation to their maxima. <strong>Spending one in Blood Alchemy</strong> pays for a purchase instead. An orb you have consumed cannot also fund the shop.</p><p>On dungeon floors 21–25, eligible vampire and blood enemies have a <strong>15% base Blood Orb chance</strong>; specified guaranteed drops bypass the roll. Applicable loot bonuses can improve the chance. This is separate from the pickaxe roll, so a pickaxe does not replace the orb chance.</p><p>Other dungeon encounters and rewards can provide Orbs. One goblin encounter trades <strong>one Blood Orb for five Dragon Coins</strong>. The Phantom Stone–Thieves Gloves extra reward can also select a Blood Orb. None of these makes an Orb guaranteed on every visit.</p></section>
<section id="en-use"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Choosing_Purchases"></span><h2>Buying from the shop</h2><ol><li>Meet effective Vampire 25 and carry enough Blood Orbs.</li><li>Open Blood Alchemy and inspect each card’s effect and price.</li><li>Select the artifact picture or its purchase control. <strong>Purchases commit immediately</strong>, and the balance updates.</li><li>Close the shop with its X when finished.</li></ol><p>A unique artifact becomes greyed out and marked <strong>OWNED</strong> after purchase. Unaffordable controls are disabled. Crimson Grail is hidden until you own Elemental Stone.</p><p>For <strong>Blood Exchange and Crimson Grail</strong>, hold <strong>Shift</strong> to quote the maximum affordable quantity and read the total price before buying. Ordinary purchase controls also support holding to repeat. These controls can spend a large stockpile quickly; check the shown quantity when splitting Orbs between upgrades.</p></section>
<section id="en-artifacts"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="One-Time_Artifacts"></span><h2>The six permanent artifacts</h2><p>All six are passive Key Items. Ownership applies their effects without an equipment-slot assignment or repeated consumption.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Artifact</th><th scope="col">Blood Orbs</th><th scope="col">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Vampire Fangs</th><td data-label="Blood Orbs">55</td><td data-label="Effect">Attack, Quick Attack, Stormslash and Power Strike have a 15% chance to bypass normal enemy defenses and add Vampire-based damage. Vampirism raises this to 18% and strengthens the damage roll.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Hypnotic Gaze</th><td data-label="Blood Orbs">50</td><td data-label="Effect">Improves Sleep Magic success; see the probability details below. It does not teach the spell.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Nocturnal Cloak</th><td data-label="Blood Orbs">50</td><td data-label="Effect">+1 effective armor level for damage reduction. Stacks with your main armor and other passive armor bonuses.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Eye of the Bat</th><td data-label="Blood Orbs">60</td><td data-label="Effect">+50 maximum Health, +50 maximum Energy and +50 maximum Calm. No maximum Satiation increase.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Draculas Ring</th><td data-label="Blood Orbs">70</td><td data-label="Effect">+1 to the maximum relationship-reward roll when your active alignment matches the NPC’s. It does not raise the minimum or remove mismatch penalties.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vampire Grimoire</th><td data-label="Blood Orbs">80</td><td data-label="Effect">Offensive Fire, Ice, Light and Dark Magic have a 15% chance to bypass normal magic defenses and add Vampire-based damage. Vampirism raises this to 18% with a stronger damage roll.</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Already-owned artifacts cannot be bought again. Draculas Ring’s relationship effect requires a matching <strong>active</strong> alignment; it does not apply while you are Unaligned.</p><details><summary>Vampire damage and Sleep Magic details</summary><p>Fangs and Grimoire normally roll bonus damage from 1 to effective Vampire. With Vampirism, the bonus rolls from 10 to one-and-a-half times effective Vampire, rounded down, with an upper bound of at least 10. These are chance effects and do not guarantee that every action hits or defeats an enemy.</p><p>Hypnotic Gaze adds <strong>10 percentage points</strong> to ordinary Sleep success after floor resistance, and raises the ordinary cap from <strong>70% to 75%</strong> before other applicable modifiers. In boss fights it raises the base chance from <strong>13% to 20%</strong>. Sleep Spores, skills, resistance and the temporary penalty after previous Sleep can still affect the result; some encounters prevent Sleep entirely.</p></details><figure class="reviewed-screenshot"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Blood Alchemy lists Orb prices for six permanent artifacts and two refinements. Owning Elemental Stone reveals Crimson Grail; balances are examples." href="../assets/images/wiki/personal-systems/en-alchemy-catalog.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Blood Alchemy lists Orb prices for six permanent artifacts and two refinements. Owning Elemental Stone reveals Crimson Grail; balances are examples." decoding="async" height="720" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/personal-systems/en-alchemy-catalog.webp" width="1280"/></a><figcaption>Blood Alchemy lists Orb prices for six permanent artifacts and two refinements. Owning Elemental Stone reveals Crimson Grail; balances are examples.</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="en-refinements"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Repeatable_Refinements"></span><h2>Repeatable refinements</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Refinement</th><th scope="col">Blood Orbs each</th><th scope="col">Requirement</th><th scope="col">Result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Blood Exchange</th><td data-label="Blood Orbs each">10</td><td data-label="Requirement">Effective Vampire 25+</td><td data-label="Result">Permanent +1 maximum Energy per purchase.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Crimson Grail</th><td data-label="Blood Orbs each">20</td><td data-label="Requirement">Effective Vampire 25+ and owned Elemental Stone</td><td data-label="Result">+1 Elemental Stone level per purchase.</td></tr></tbody></table><p>There is no shop-imposed daily limit or upgrade-level cap on these refinements. Blood Exchange increases capacity; it does not refill Energy or raise Vampire. Crimson Grail upgrades the stone you already own, rather than granting a new one.</p><p>For comparison, Eye of the Bat gives +50 Energy capacity and two other +50 maxima for 60 Orbs, while Blood Exchange costs 10 Orbs per Energy point. Choose the unique artifacts you want before committing a large amount to repeatable upgrades. A spell-focused character may instead value Elemental Stone levels, while a physical build may prioritize Fangs.</p><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 470px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Blood Exchange increases maximum Energy; Crimson Grail raises your owned Elemental Stone. Both spend the same Orb inventory." href="../assets/images/wiki/personal-systems/en-alchemy-refinements-full.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Blood Exchange increases maximum Energy; Crimson Grail raises your owned Elemental Stone. Both spend the same Orb inventory." decoding="async" height="245" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/personal-systems/en-alchemy-refinements.webp" width="470"/></a><figcaption>Blood Exchange increases maximum Energy; Crimson Grail raises your owned Elemental Stone. Both spend the same Orb inventory.</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>If a purchase is missing or disabled</h2><ul><li><strong>Blood Alchemy is absent:</strong> enter the Vampire Laboratory and check effective Vampire 25, including modifiers.</li><li><strong>An artifact is disabled:</strong> check the carried Orb balance and whether the item is already owned.</li><li><strong>Crimson Grail is absent:</strong> collect Elemental Stone first.</li><li><strong>Orbs ran out:</strong> inventory use, ordinary purchases and bulk purchases all spend from the same stock.</li><li><strong>A skill did not appear:</strong> the artifacts enhance effects; buying Gaze does not teach Sleep Magic, and buying Fangs or Grimoire does not teach Vampirism.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="character-ruxandra.html">Ruxandra</a> covers her personal route. See <a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">Dungeon</a> for access, <a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">Soul Stones</a> for Elemental Stone, <a href="game-systems-alignment-system.html">Alignment</a> for the Ring, and <a href="items.html">Items</a> for other consumables and upgrades.</p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Vampire_damage_and_Sleep_details"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Using_the_Shop"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Finding_the_Shop"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>用鲜血宝珠换永久升级</h2><p><strong>Ruxandra 的血液炼金</strong>位于吸血鬼巢穴内的<strong>吸血鬼实验室</strong>，可用鲜血宝珠购买六件永久物品与两项可重复强化。打开商店和购买都不推进游戏时间。</p><p>进入<strong>「血液炼金」</strong>需要<strong>有效吸血鬼属性至少 25</strong>，适用的属性修正也计入。商店不要求特定关系阶段或个人剧情完成；<strong>吸血鬼化</strong>技能会增强其中两件物品的效果，但不是购物前置。</p><p>请准备<strong>尚未使用的鲜血宝珠</strong>。财富、水晶或龙币不能支付这里的价格。六件一次性物品合计 <strong>365 鲜血宝珠</strong>，重复强化也从同一份库存扣除。</p></section>
<section id="zh-access"><h2>如何前往实验室</h2><p>Ruxandra 全天在实验室。进入吸血鬼巢穴后，前往<strong>吸血鬼实验室</strong>，再从地点行动中选择<strong>血液炼金</strong>。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">路线</th><th scope="col">开放条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">普通地下城</th><td data-label="开放条件">到达第23层并进入城堡格子；这条入口不要求完成主线第61段。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">城市图书馆捷径</th><td data-label="开放条件">主线第61段后：现代 → 上城区 → 城市图书馆（上城区）→ 图书馆地下室 → 黑暗走廊 → 吸血鬼巢穴 → 吸血鬼实验室。</td></tr></tbody></table><p>城市图书馆通常在<strong>08:00–22:00</strong>开放，剧情中的暂时关闭也可能阻止进入。从市中心出发，可在地铁站选择<strong>「前往上城区」</strong>，耗时30分钟，再使用上城区地图的图书馆图标。进入图书馆后，通往实验室的地下移动行动不耗时。</p><p>巢穴的返回地下城传送门会把你送回探索区域。地点入口与 Ruxandra 的个人剧情各有条件，都不能代替商店本身的吸血鬼属性要求。</p></section>
<section id="zh-orbs"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Getting_more_Blood_Orbs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Blood_Orbs"></span><h2>鲜血宝珠该使用还是留着？</h2><p>同一颗鲜血宝珠有两种不同用途。<strong>在背包中使用</strong>会消耗一颗，使基础吸血鬼属性 +1，最高999，并将当前生命、精力、镇定和饱腹感（部分界面显示「饱腹度」）恢复至上限。<strong>在血液炼金中支付</strong>则会换来对应商品。已经使用的宝珠不能再拿去购物。</p><p>地下城21–25层中，符合条件的吸血鬼与鲜血敌人有<strong>15%基础概率</strong>掉落鲜血宝珠，指定必掉敌人则直接发放。适用的战利品加成可提高概率。这与镐的掉落分别判定，掉了镐不代表宝珠机会就被替代。</p><p>其他地下城遭遇与奖励也能提供宝珠。其中一个哥布林遭遇可用<strong>5龙币换1鲜血宝珠</strong>；幻影之石与盗贼手套的额外奖励池也包含宝珠。但并非每次探索都会保证遇到这些来源。</p></section>
<section id="zh-use"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Choosing_Purchases"></span><h2>商店怎么用</h2><ol><li>让有效吸血鬼属性达到25，并带足鲜血宝珠。</li><li>打开血液炼金，查看卡片上的效果与价格。</li><li>点击物品图片或购买控件。<strong>购买立即生效</strong>，余额随即更新。</li><li>购买完后用商店的X关闭。</li></ol><p>已买的一次性物品会变灰并标记为已拥有；余额不足的购买控件不可用。猩红圣杯要等拥有元素之石后才会显示。</p><p><strong>血之交易与猩红圣杯</strong>支持按住<strong>Shift</strong>查看最大可购买数量，请先看清数量与合计价格。普通购买控件也支持按住连续购买，可能很快花掉大量库存；想分配到多个用途时，应留意当前报价。</p></section>
<section id="zh-artifacts"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-One-Time_Artifacts"></span><h2>六件永久物品</h2><p>六件商品都是持有即生效的被动关键物品，无须占用装备栏，也不用反复消耗。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">物品</th><th scope="col">鲜血宝珠</th><th scope="col">效果</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">吸血鬼獠牙</th><td data-label="鲜血宝珠">55</td><td data-label="效果">攻击、快速攻击、风暴斩与强力打击有15%概率绕过普通敌方防御，并增加基于吸血鬼属性的伤害。持有吸血鬼化技能后为18%，额外伤害掷值也更强。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">催眠凝视</th><td data-label="鲜血宝珠">50</td><td data-label="效果">提高催眠魔法成功率，详见下方概率说明；不会直接教会该法术。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">夜行斗篷</th><td data-label="鲜血宝珠">50</td><td data-label="效果">减伤计算中的有效护甲等级+1，可与主护甲及其他被动护甲加成叠加。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">蝙蝠之眼</th><td data-label="鲜血宝珠">60</td><td data-label="效果">最大生命、最大精力、最大镇定各+50，不增加最大饱腹感。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">德古拉之戒</th><td data-label="鲜血宝珠">70</td><td data-label="效果">当前生效阵营与角色一致时，关系奖励掷值上限+1；不提高下限，也不消除阵营不合的惩罚。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">吸血鬼魔导书</th><td data-label="鲜血宝珠">80</td><td data-label="效果">攻击性的火焰、冰霜、光明与黑暗魔法有15%概率绕过普通魔法防御，并增加基于吸血鬼属性的伤害。吸血鬼化技能使概率升至18%，额外伤害掷值也更强。</td></tr></tbody></table><p>已拥有的永久物品不能重复购买。德古拉之戒需要<strong>当前生效</strong>的阵营相合，处于无阵营状态时不会触发这项加成。</p><details><summary>吸血鬼额外伤害与催眠魔法概率</summary><p>獠牙和魔导书通常从1到有效吸血鬼属性之间掷出额外伤害；有吸血鬼化技能时，改为从10到有效属性的1.5倍向下取整，上限至少为10。这些都是概率效果，不保证每次行动都能命中或击败敌人。</p><p>催眠凝视在普通催眠判定扣除楼层抗性后增加<strong>10个百分点</strong>，并将其他适用修正前的普通上限由<strong>70%提高至75%</strong>。首领战中的基础成功率则由<strong>13%提高至20%</strong>。沉睡孢子、技能、抗性与前一次催眠后的临时惩罚仍可能影响结果，部分遭遇会完全禁止催眠。</p></details><figure class="reviewed-screenshot"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：血液炼金列出六件永久物品与两项强化的宝珠价格。持有元素之石后会显示猩红圣杯，余额仅为示例。" href="../assets/images/wiki/personal-systems/zh-alchemy-catalog.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="血液炼金列出六件永久物品与两项强化的宝珠价格。持有元素之石后会显示猩红圣杯，余额仅为示例。" decoding="async" height="720" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/personal-systems/zh-alchemy-catalog.webp" width="1280"/></a><figcaption>血液炼金列出六件永久物品与两项强化的宝珠价格。持有元素之石后会显示猩红圣杯，余额仅为示例。</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="zh-refinements"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Repeatable_Refinements"></span><h2>两项可重复强化</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">强化</th><th scope="col">每次鲜血宝珠</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">效果</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">血之交易</th><td data-label="每次鲜血宝珠">10</td><td data-label="条件">有效吸血鬼属性25以上</td><td data-label="效果">每次永久增加1点最大精力。</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">猩红圣杯</th><td data-label="每次鲜血宝珠">20</td><td data-label="条件">有效吸血鬼属性25以上，且持有元素之石</td><td data-label="效果">每次使元素之石提高1级。</td></tr></tbody></table><p>商店没有为这两项强化设置每日次数或升级等级上限。血之交易提高的是容量，不会补满精力或提高吸血鬼属性；猩红圣杯强化已有的元素之石，不会给予一枚新石头。</p><p>可作比较：蝙蝠之眼花60宝珠便能增加50最大精力，并提高另外两种容量；血之交易则是每10宝珠换1点精力容量。大量购买重复强化前，可先决定想要哪些永久物品。常用魔法的角色也可能更重视元素之石等级，近战角色则可考虑獠牙。</p><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 470px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：血之交易提高精力上限，猩红圣杯提升已持有的元素之石等级，两者都消耗同一份宝珠库存。" href="../assets/images/wiki/personal-systems/zh-alchemy-refinements-full.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="血之交易提高精力上限，猩红圣杯提升已持有的元素之石等级，两者都消耗同一份宝珠库存。" decoding="async" height="245" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/personal-systems/zh-alchemy-refinements.webp" width="470"/></a><figcaption>血之交易提高精力上限，猩红圣杯提升已持有的元素之石等级，两者都消耗同一份宝珠库存。</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>找不到商品或无法购买时</h2><ul><li><strong>没有血液炼金行动：</strong>确认人在吸血鬼实验室，并检查包含修正在内的有效吸血鬼属性是否达到25。</li><li><strong>永久物品不可点击：</strong>检查随身宝珠是否足够，以及是否已经拥有。</li><li><strong>没有猩红圣杯：</strong>先收集元素之石。</li><li><strong>宝珠不足：</strong>背包使用、单次购买和批量购买消耗的都是同一份库存。</li><li><strong>没有学到技能：</strong>商品增强的是效果；催眠凝视不会教会催眠魔法，獠牙与魔导书也不会教会吸血鬼化。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><h2>相关指南</h2><p><a href="character-ruxandra.html">Ruxandra</a>指南介绍个人路线；<a href="game-systems-dungeon.html">地下城</a>说明入口，<a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">灵魂石</a>介绍元素之石，<a href="game-systems-alignment-system.html">阵营系统</a>说明戒指条件，<a href="items.html">物品</a>整理其他消耗品与升级。</p></section>
